      "title": "AI-assisted cyber situational awareness generates step-by-step reasoning traces for human review",
      "summary": "AI-assisted cyber situational awareness triggers machine-generated reasoning traces that a human operator is expected to review. Because signals and traces arrive faster than any operator can process, human review is the limiting constraint on oversight.",
      "design_implication": "In an admin console where automated security flags flood the interface faster than a human can read them, alerts must be batched by confidence thresholds. Designers need to build summary views that convey systemic risk without requiring tedious line-by-line validation.",
      "implication_lens": "trust_and_risk",
      "visual_need": "illustrate",
